	JMS	FIL2BF 		/ FILL THE DOCNBF BUFFER AND RELEASE THIS ONE
	JMP	AXRT3 		/ SEE IF THE KEYBOARD ROUTINE IS USEING THE MENU
AXRT4,	JMS	INIWAT 		/ DO A JWAIT AND THEN CHECK SPFLAG
