	JMP	HSTWAT 		/ RETURN AND WAIT AT MAIN LOOP

AXRT3,	TAD	DISTMP
	SZA CLA 		/ ++++
	 JMP	AXRT4
	AC7777			/ SET FLAG BEFORE ENTERING THIS SECTION	/A039
	DCA	DISTMP		/					/A039
	JMS	CLASTA		/ CLEAR THE FLAGS FOR A TRANSFER	/C031
	TAD	TEMP 		/ TELL THE OTHER FIELD WHICH MODE TO GO TO
	CIFBUF
	JMS I	AXSRA
		DOCNBF			/ THE ADDRESS OF THE POINTER TO THE BUFFER RECEIVED
/D039	 JMP	HSTWAT 		/ NO RETURN
	 JMP	AXRTNO		/ NO RETURN				/A039
	DCA	DOCNO 		/ SAVE THE DOCUMENT NUMBER
	MQA
	DCA	DOCMOD 		/ AND THE MODIFICATION VALUE
	AC0002
	TAD	TEMP 		/ SET THE PROMPT FLAG SO WHEN THE ANSWER PAKCET IS
