				/ SINCE IT WILL NOW ACT LIKE THE ANSWER TO A
				/ SEND OR RECEIVE PROMPT
	DCA	PMTTMP
	TAD	TEMP 		/ IF SET FOR RECEIVE OR SEND SET THE CORRECT FLAG
	SNA CLA 		/ ++++
	JMP	AXRT2
	ISZ	SNDAD 		/ SET AX SEND FLAG
/D039	JMP	HSTWAT
	JMP	AXRTNO		/					/A039
AXRT2,	ISZ	AXREC 		/ SET AX RECEIVE FLAG
